### 课程与选课模块 API 测试
### 先执行 01-auth.http 中的 loginStudent / loginTeacher

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
@teacherToken = {{loginTeacher.response.body.token}}

### TC-COURSE-001 浏览已发布课程列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-COURSE-002 按关键词搜索课程
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses?search=程序设计
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-COURSE-003 教师查看我的课程
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### TC-ENROLL-001 查看选课窗口状态
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/status
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-ENROLL-002 选课目录（含筛选）
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/catalog
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-ENROLL-003 学生选课（将 {{courseId}} 替换为 catalog 中某门课 id）
@courseId = REPLACE_WITH_COURSE_ID
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/courses/{{courseId}}/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### TC-ENROLL-004 学生退课
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/courses/{{courseId}}/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-ENROLL-005 已满课程选课（CS901，seed fixture）
@fullCourseId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090001
GET {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/catalog?courseCode=CS901
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 预期 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/courses/{{fullCourseId}}/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 预期 200 候补
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/courses/{{fullCourseId}}/waitlist
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### TC-ENROLL-006 非选课窗口（需 admin 先关闭窗口，测完请重新 seed 或恢复 period）
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.token}}
@closedWindowCourseId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000090030
PUT {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/period
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phase": "CLOSED",
  "openAt": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z",
  "closeAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z"
}

### 预期 403
POST {{baseUrl}}/enrollment/courses/{{closedWindowCourseId}}/enroll
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### TC-COURSE-004 教师创建课程
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "测试课程-{{$timestamp}}",
  "description": "测试报告用例创建",
  "courseCode": "TEST{{$timestamp}}",
  "credits": 2,
  "capacity": 50,
  "courseNature": "ELECTIVE",
  "subjectCategory": "CORE_MAJOR",
  "published": false
}
